# Assets

Prefer SVG for suitable game UI vector assets.

SVG requirements:

- descriptive filename
- valid viewBox
- transparent background where appropriate
- no unnecessary masks
- no embedded raster artwork unless approved
- Godot compatible
- organized directories

Theme-specific vectors belong in `assets/svg/themes/<theme_name>/`.

Never replace an approved asset with a random alternative.
